 },
 "lines": [
  {"text": "In 2008, a star NFL quarterback said he didn't know games could end in a tie. He'd just played one.",
   "key": ["TIE."], "speaker": "capy",
   "place": {"capy": [-2.4, 0.8], "qb": [0, 0], "bengal": [2.2, 0.2], "mate": false, "coach": false},
   "shot": {"type": "two", "on": "capy", "with": "qb"},
   "act": {"capy": {"mood": "smug", "action": "talk", "look": "camera"}, "qb": {"mood": "confused", "action": "shrug", "look": "capy"}, "bengal": {"mood": "confused", "look": "qb"}}},
  {"text": "Eagles against Bengals, November 2008. Thirteen all after four quarters.",
   "cap": "Eagles against Bengals, November 2008. 13 all after four quarters.",
   "key": ["13"],
   "place": {"capy": false, "qb": [-1.3, 0], "bengal": [1.3, 0]},
   "shot": {"type": "wide", "on": "qb", "offset": [1.3, 0, -2]},
   "act": {"qb": {"mood": "neutral", "action": "hold", "look": "bengal"}, "bengal": {"mood": "neutral", "look": "qb"}}},
  {"text": "Overtime: fifteen minutes. Neither offense scored.",
   "cap": "Overtime: 15 minutes. Neither offense scored.",
   "key": ["15"],
   "board": ["OVERTIME", "15:00"],
   "shot": {"type": "two", "on": "qb", "with": "bengal"},
   "act": {"qb": {"mood": "angry", "action": "throw"}, "bengal": {"mood": "worried", "action": "idle"}}},
  {"text": "Donovan McNabb's line: twenty eight of fifty eight, three interceptions and a lost fumble.",
   "cap": "Donovan McNabb's line: 28 of 58, 3 interceptions and a lost fumble.",
   "key": ["58,"],
   "board": ["28 OF 58", "3 INT"],
   "place": {"qb": [0, 0], "bengal": false},
   "shot": {"type": "medium", "on": "qb"},
   "act": {"qb": {"mood": "sad", "action": "slump", "look": "camera"}}},
  {"text": "With seven seconds left, Cincinnati missed a forty seven yard field goal.",
   "cap": "With 7 seconds left, Cincinnati missed a 47-yard field goal.",
   "key": ["47-YARD"],
   "board": ["0:07", "NO GOOD"],
   "place": {"bengal": [0, 0], "qb": [2.2, -0.6]},
   "shot": {"type": "low", "on": "bengal"},
   "act": {"bengal": {"mood": "shocked", "action": "facepalm"}, "qb": {"mood": "happy", "action": "clap"}}},
  {"text": "The clock hit zero. Final: thirteen, thirteen.",
   "cap": "The clock hit zero. Final: 13-13.",
   "key": ["13-13."],
   "board": ["FINAL", "13 - 13"],
   "place": {"qb": [-1.3, 0], "bengal": [1.3, 0]},
   "shot": {"type": "high", "on": "qb", "offset": [1.3, 0, 0]},
   "act": {"qb": {"mood": "confused", "action": "shrug"}, "bengal": {"mood": "confused", "action": "shrug"}}},
  {"text": "The first NFL tie in six years.",
   "cap": "The first NFL tie in 6 years.",
   "key": ["6"],
   "place": {"capy": [0, 1.6]},
   "shot": {"type": "medium", "on": "capy"},
   "act": {"capy": {"mood": "neutral", "action": "point", "look": "camera"}},
   "speaker": "capy"},
  {"text": "Afterward, he told reporters he never even knew a tie was in the rule book.",
   "key": ["RULE", "BOOK."],
   "set": "press",
   "board": ["POSTGAME", "TIE?"],
   "place": {"qb": "center"},
   "shot": {"type": "medium", "on": "qb"},
   "act": {"qb": {"mood": "confused", "action": "talk", "look": "camera"}}},
  {"text": "He didn't know playoff games just keep going.",
   "key": ["PLAYOFF"],
   "shot": {"type": "close", "on": "qb"},
   "act": {"qb": {"mood": "worried", "action": "shrug", "look": "camera"}}},
  {"text": "He wasn't alone. Several teammates didn't know either.",
   "key": ["TEAMMATES"],
   "set": "locker",
   "board": ["TIES:", "WHAT?"],
   "place": {"qb": [-1.2, 0.2], "mate": [1.2, 0.2]},
   "shot": {"type": "two", "on": "qb", "with": "mate"},
   "act": {"qb": {"mood": "confused", "action": "shrug", "look": "mate"}, "mate": {"mood": "confused", "action": "shrug", "look": "qb"}}},
  {"text": "His coach, Andy Reid, said he'd take the responsibility for that.",
   "key": ["RESPONSIBILITY"],
   "place": {"coach": [0, 0.4], "qb": [-2.2, 0], "mate": false},
   "shot": {"type": "low", "on": "coach"},
   "act": {"coach": {"mood": "neutral", "action": "hold", "look": "camera"}, "qb": {"mood": "sad", "look": "coach"}}},
  {"text": "One week later, at Baltimore, the quarterback was pulled at halftime.",
   "key": ["HALFTIME."],
   "set": "tunnel",
   "board": ["HALFTIME", "QB CHANGE"],
   "place": {"qb": [0, 0]},
   "shot": {"type": "medium", "on": "qb"},
   "act": {"qb": {"mood": "sad", "action": "slump", "look": "camera"}}},
  {"text": "Did you know an NFL game could end in a tie? Yes or no?",
